Package: cubical-compare
Version: 1.0.0
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: RetroFrost
Depends: libgtk-4-1, ffmpeg
Description: Native comparison-video editor
 Cubical Compare imports spreadsheet data and image sheets, edits comparison
 cards, mixes soundtracks, and exports animated MP4 videos through its
 privately bundled rendering engine.
